00:04:59.501 --> 00:05:01.234
-Am I green?
-No, yeah, you're green.

00:05:01.234 --> 00:05:03.133
Yeah. You're green. I'm red.

00:05:03.133 --> 00:05:05.400
Computer Man!

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:06.934
What are you doing here?!

00:05:06.934 --> 00:05:09.067
-Oh, hello, Captain Stinky.

00:05:09.067 --> 00:05:13.467
-Please call me by my nickname,
Mr. Caterpillar.

00:05:13.467 --> 00:05:15.601
-I'm here for the same reason
you are here --

00:05:15.601 --> 00:05:19.000
to rescue the koala stuck
on the roof of this Chipotle.

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.400
-I knew
there was trouble tonight

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:22.234
when I saw my signal
in the sky --

00:05:22.234 --> 00:05:25.000
a light projected
in the shape of a...baby.

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:27.567
[ Laughter ]

00:05:27.567 --> 00:05:31.534
-Well, using our powers,
this rescue should be simple.

00:05:31.534 --> 00:05:33.000
I'm faster
than a speeding spatula,

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:36.133
and everything I touch
turns to fungi.

00:05:36.133 --> 00:05:37.300
-Impressive.

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:40.501
I have the agility
of a platypus.

00:05:40.501 --> 00:05:43.267
And when I get really smokey,

00:05:43.267 --> 00:05:45.434
I turn into
Benedict Cumberbatch.

00:05:45.434 --> 00:05:47.033
[ Laughter ]

00:05:47.033 --> 00:05:48.501
-Wow.

00:05:48.501 --> 00:05:50.968
I must tell you,
my back story is complicated.

00:05:50.968 --> 00:05:54.868
When I was eleven tousand
years old, I was...

00:05:54.868 --> 00:05:56.400
I was once bitten by a genie.

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:58.000
[ Laughter ]

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:03.033
And ever since, I've been able
to emanate mooses from my elbow.

00:06:03.033 --> 00:06:06.734
-Why did you let go, Jack?

00:06:06.734 --> 00:06:08.400
-I know.

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:11.133
It's amazing, but with great
power comes great burrito.

00:06:11.133 --> 00:06:13.234
[ Laughter ]

00:06:13.234 --> 00:06:15.267
-Your story
reminds me of my own.

00:06:15.267 --> 00:06:16.734
I became a superhero

00:06:16.734 --> 00:06:19.934
