of radioactive bloody Mary.

00:06:19.934 --> 00:06:22.767
But listen.
We must complete this rescue.

00:06:22.767 --> 00:06:25.000
Because there's something
you don't know.

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:27.968
In the trapped koala's collar,
there's a USB drive

00:06:27.968 --> 00:06:31.801
that contains images of
Waka Flocka Flame clenching...

00:06:31.801 --> 00:06:33.667
[ Laughter ]

00:06:37.467 --> 00:06:39.033
Clenching his...

00:06:39.033 --> 00:06:40.701
-Aah.

00:06:40.701 --> 00:06:43.501
-No, no.
His fist, his fist, his fist.

00:06:43.501 --> 00:06:44.901
-Yes.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:06:44.901 --> 00:06:46.834
-And as a warning,
I do have one weakness.

00:06:46.834 --> 00:06:48.334
-What is it?

00:06:48.334 --> 00:06:51.300
-Backstreet Boys.

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:52.667
-That's okay.

00:06:52.667 --> 00:06:55.467
Just remember what
Professor Tom Brady told us.

00:06:55.467 --> 00:06:57.367
He said if we're ever
in a situation like this,

00:06:57.367 --> 00:06:58.634
you press this button,

00:06:58.634 --> 00:07:02.367
and we will both
immediately start crying.

00:07:02.367 --> 00:07:04.634
Here we go.

00:07:04.634 --> 00:07:06.234
[ Both fake crying ]

00:07:06.234 --> 00:07:08.167
It's working!

00:07:08.167 --> 00:07:12.801
Our crying is causing
the koala to be saved!

00:07:12.801 --> 00:07:16.100
-Garage, Minaj! We did it!

00:07:16.100 --> 00:07:18.234
-Yes, let's high-five
and say the secret

00:07:18.234 --> 00:07:20.100
