on "three."

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:21.634
One, two, three.

00:07:21.634 --> 00:07:23.234
Uh...

00:07:23.234 --> 00:07:25.467
-Iri-dira-calaptus.
-[ Stammering ]

00:07:25.467 --> 00:07:27.767
-Dude!

00:07:27.767 --> 00:07:29.334
-Yeah!
-And scene!

00:07:29.334 --> 00:07:30.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:30.767 --> 00:07:33.667
My thanks...

00:07:33.667 --> 00:07:36.801
My thanks to Colson Baker,
a.k.a. Machine Gun Kelly.

